    "Parametric starting points (contracts section 10). Degrees. flex = [proximal, middle, distal] curl toward the palm;",
    "spread > 0 moves a finger toward the thumb; roll (thumb only) turns the thumb about its own axis.",
    "Auto-grip starts from the chosen preset and closes each finger until it touches the weapon.",
    "lock lists fingers auto-grip must leave alone (e.g. the trigger finger)."
